  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-Y.4419 specifies requirements and capabilities for support for smart utility metering (SUM). Smart utility metering (SUM) can provide remote data collection for utility metering and device maintenance in real time and can support a variety of applications. Compared with other types of utility metering, SUM intends to improve utility management and meet the emerging requirements from advanced applications, such as intelligent utility scheduling.</abstract>
